Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:25.10,C_id,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episode GRATIS ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.98,S_id,,0,0,0,,Yang tua berani sakiti IBUku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.02,0:00:03.98,S_id,,0,0,0,,Bocah ini kelewatan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.02,0:00:15.20,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kau biarkan Dark Phoenix menghancurkan tanah leluhur,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:17.20,S_id,,0,0,0,,hingga pohon leluhur layu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.24,0:00:19.20,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kau tak layak lagi menjadi ratu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.24,0:00:23.09,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kalau mau merebut takhta, bilang saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.13,0:00:25.09,S_id,,0,0,0,,Jangan pakai anak sebagai alasan.
